From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheRock contributors <therockbot@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rocshmem: remove unused x86 intrinsic headers

backend_ro.cpp does not use x86 intrinsics. Remove the headers so the
reverse offload backend can also be compiled on non-x86 hosts.

---
diff --git a/projects/rocshmem/src/reverse_offload/backend_ro.cpp b/projects/rocshmem/src/reverse_offload/backend_ro.cpp
--- a/projects/rocshmem/src/reverse_offload/backend_ro.cpp
+++ b/projects/rocshmem/src/reverse_offload/backend_ro.cpp
@@ -24,8 +24,6 @@
 
 #include "backend_ro.hpp"
 
-#include <immintrin.h>
-#include <smmintrin.h>
 #include <unistd.h>
 
 #include <cassert>
-- 
2.39.5
